      "id": "claim_73a80c606f904b1b82eae115b4273b89",
      "statement": "WorkflowPushGuardMiddleware intercepts execute and background_execute calls only for conservatively parsed current-branch pushes to origin; it inspects the sandbox diff and passes an eligible push through unchanged when no `.github/workflows/` path changed, while chained pushes that may carry workflow edits must be standalone.",
